{"suttaId":"tha-ap535","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[4065,4190],"vripara":"66"},"segments":{"tha-ap535:0.3":"Mahākappinattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap535:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","tha-ap535:1.3":"Udito ajaṭākāse [jagadākāse (sī.), jaladākāse (pī.)], ravīva saradambare.","tha-ap535:2.1":"“Vacanābhāya bodheti, veneyyapadumāni so;","tha-ap535:2.3":"Kilesapaṅkaṃ soseti, matiraṃsīhi nāyako.","tha-ap535:3.1":"“Titthiyānaṃ yase [yaso (sī. pī.)] hanti, khajjotābhā yathā ravi;","tha-ap535:3.3":"Saccatthābhaṃ pakāseti, ratanaṃva divākaro.","tha-ap535:4.1":"“Guṇānaṃ āyatibhūto, ratanānaṃva sāgaro;","tha-ap535:4.3":"Pajjunnoriva bhūtāni, dhammameghena vassati.","tha-ap535:5.1":"“Akkhadasso tadā āsiṃ, nagare haṃsasavhaye;","tha-ap535:5.3":"Upecca dhammamassosiṃ, jalajuttamanāmino.","tha-ap535:6.1":"“Ovādakassa bhikkhūnaṃ, sāvakassa katāvino;","tha-ap535:6.3":"Guṇaṃ pakāsayantassa, tappayantassa [tosayantassa (sī.), hāsayantassa (syā.), vāsayantassa (pī.)] me manaṃ.","tha-ap535:7.1":"“Sutvā patīto sumano, nimantetvā tathāgataṃ;","tha-ap535:7.3":"Sasissaṃ bhojayitvāna, taṃ ṭhānamabhipatthayiṃ.","tha-ap535:8.1":"“Tadā haṃsasamabhāgo, haṃsadundubhinissano [haṃsadundubhisussaro (sī.)];","tha-ap535:8.3":"Passathetaṃ mahāmattaṃ, vinicchayavisāradaṃ.","tha-ap535:9.1":"“Patitaṃ pādamūle me, samuggatatanūruhaṃ;","tha-ap535:9.3":"Jīmūtavaṇṇaṃ pīṇaṃsaṃ, pasannanayanānanaṃ.","tha-ap535:10.1":"“Parivārena mahatā, rājayuttaṃ mahāyasaṃ;","tha-ap535:10.3":"Eso katāvino ṭhānaṃ, pattheti muditāsayo.","tha-ap535:11.1":"“‘Iminā paṇipātena, cāgena paṇidhīhi ca [piṇḍapātena, cetanā paṇidhīhi ca (sī.)];","tha-ap535:11.3":"Kappasatasahassāni, nupapajjati duggatiṃ.","tha-ap535:12.1":"“‘Devesu devasobhaggaṃ, manussesu mahantataṃ;","tha-ap535:12.3":"Anubhotvāna sesena [abhutvāva sesena (sī.), anubhotvāva sesena (syā.)], nibbānaṃ pāpuṇissati.","tha-ap535:13.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap535:13.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap535:14.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;","tha-ap535:14.3":"Kappino nāma nāmena, hessati satthu sāvako’.","tha-ap535:15.1":"“Tatohaṃ sukataṃ kāraṃ, katvāna jinasāsane;","tha-ap535:15.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tusitaṃ agamāsahaṃ.","tha-ap535:16.1":"“Devamānusarajjāni, sataso anusāsiya;","tha-ap535:16.3":"Bārāṇasiyamāsanne, jāto keniyajātiyaṃ.","tha-ap535:17.1":"“Sahassaparivārena [satasahassaparivāro (syā.)], sapajāpatiko ahaṃ;","tha-ap535:17.3":"Pañca paccekabuddhānaṃ, satāni samupaṭṭhahiṃ.","tha-ap535:18.1":"“Temāsaṃ bhojayitvāna, pacchādamha ticīvaraṃ;","tha-ap535:18.3":"Tato cutā mayaṃ sabbe, ahumha tidasūpagā.","tha-ap535:19.1":"“Puno sabbe manussattaṃ, agamimha tato cutā;","tha-ap535:19.3":"Kukkuṭamhi pure jātā, himavantassa passato.","tha-ap535:20.1":"“Kappino nāmahaṃ āsiṃ, rājaputto mahāyaso;","tha-ap535:20.3":"Sesāmaccakule jātā, mameva parivārayuṃ.","tha-ap535:21.1":"“Mahārajjasukhaṃ patto, sabbakāmasamiddhimā;","tha-ap535:21.3":"Vāṇijehi samakkhātaṃ, buddhuppādamahaṃ suṇiṃ.","tha-ap535:22.1":"“‘Buddho loke samuppanno, asamo ekapuggalo;","tha-ap535:22.3":"So pakāseti saddhammaṃ, amataṃ sukhamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap535:23.1":"“‘Suyuttā tassa sissā ca, sumuttā ca anāsavā’;","tha-ap535:23.3":"“Sutvā nesaṃ suvacanaṃ, sakkaritvāna vāṇije.","tha-ap535:24.1":"“Pahāya rajjaṃ sāmacco, nikkhamiṃ buddhamāmako;","tha-ap535:24.3":"Nadiṃ disvā mahācandaṃ, pūritaṃ samatittikaṃ.","tha-ap535:25.1":"“Appatiṭṭhaṃ anālambaṃ, duttaraṃ sīghavāhiniṃ;","tha-ap535:25.3":"Guṇaṃ saritvā buddhassa, sotthinā samatikkamiṃ.","tha-ap535:26.1":"“‘Bhavasotaṃ sace buddho, tiṇṇo lokantagū vidū [vibhū (ka.)];","tha-ap535:26.3":"Etena saccavajjena, gamanaṃ me samijjhatu.","tha-ap535:27.1":"“‘Yadi santigamo maggo, mokkho caccantikaṃ [mokkhadaṃ santikaṃ (syā.)] sukhaṃ;","tha-ap535:27.3":"Etena saccavajjena, gamanaṃ me samijjhatu.","tha-ap535:28.1":"“‘Saṅgho ce tiṇṇakantāro, puññakkhetto anuttaro;","tha-ap535:28.3":"Etena saccavajjena, gamanaṃ me samijjhatu’.","tha-ap535:29.1":"“Saha kate saccavare, maggā apagataṃ jalaṃ;","tha-ap535:29.3":"Tato sukhena uttiṇṇo, nadītīre manorame.","tha-ap535:30.1":"“Nisinnaṃ addasaṃ buddhaṃ, udentaṃva pabhaṅkaraṃ;","tha-ap535:30.3":"Jalantaṃ hemaselaṃva, dīparukkhaṃva jotitaṃ.","tha-ap535:31.1":"“Sasiṃva tārāsahitaṃ, sāvakehi purakkhataṃ;","tha-ap535:31.3":"Vāsavaṃ viya vassantaṃ, desanājaladantaraṃ [devena jalanandanaṃ (syā. pī.)].","tha-ap535:32.1":"“Vanditvāna sahāmacco, ekamantamupāvisiṃ;","tha-ap535:32.3":"Tato no āsayaṃ [tato ajjhāsayaṃ (syā.)] ñatvā, buddho dhammamadesayi.","tha-ap535:33.1":"“Sutvāna dhammaṃ vimalaṃ, avocumha mayaṃ jinaṃ;","tha-ap535:33.3":"‘Pabbājehi mahāvīra, nibbindāmha [nibbinnāmha (sī. pī.), otiṇṇamha (syā.)] mayaṃ bhave’.","tha-ap535:34.1":"“‘Svakkhāto bhikkhave dhammo, dukkhantakaraṇāya vo;","tha-ap535:34.3":"Caratha brahmacariyaṃ’, iccāha munisattamo.","tha-ap535:35.1":"“Saha vācāya sabbepi, bhikkhuvesadharā mayaṃ;","tha-ap535:35.3":"Ahumha upasampannā, sotāpannā ca sāsane.","tha-ap535:36.1":"“Tato jetavanaṃ gantvā, anusāsi vināyako;","tha-ap535:36.3":"Anusiṭṭho jinenāhaṃ, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap535:37.1":"“Tato bhikkhusahassāni [bhikkhusahassaṃ taṃ (sī. pī.)], anusāsimahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap535:37.3":"Mamānusāsanakarā, tepi āsuṃ anāsavā.","tha-ap535:38.1":"“Jino tasmiṃ guṇe tuṭṭho, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ;","tha-ap535:38.3":"Bhikkhuovādakānaggo, kappinoti mahājane.","tha-ap535:39.1":"“Satasahasse kataṃ kammaṃ, phalaṃ dassesi me idha;","tha-ap535:39.3":"Pamutto saravegova, kilese jhāpayiṃ [jhāpayī (sī.)] mama.","tha-ap535:40.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap535:41.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap535:42.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap535:43.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā mahākappino thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap535:44.1":"Mahākappinattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3428,"to":3434,"paras":[{"para":3428,"vripara":"66","refs":["tha-ap535:1"],"words":["padumuttaro nāma jino","udito ajaṭākāse","ravīva","saradambare"],"lines":["Evaṃ thero pattaarahattaphalo attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumuttaro nāma jino</b>tiādimāha.","<b>Udito ajaṭākāse</b>ti sakalākāse udito uṭṭhito pākaṭabhūto.","<b>Saradambare</b> saradakāle ākāse <b>ravīva</b> sūriyo ivāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap535:1"],["tha-ap535:1"],["tha-ap535:1"]]},{"para":3429,"vripara":"70","refs":["tha-ap535:5"],"words":["akkhadasso tadā āsiṃ"],"lines":["<b>Akkhadasso tadā āsin</b>ti tasmiṃ padumuttarassa bhagavato kāle sāradassī hitadassī ācariyo pākaṭo ahosinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap535:5"]]},{"para":3430,"vripara":"71","refs":["tha-ap535:6"],"words":["sāvakassa katāvino","me manaṃ","tappayantassa"],"lines":["<b>Sāvakassa katāvino</b>ti tassa bhagavato <b>me manaṃ</b> mama cittaṃ, <b>tappayantassa</b> tosayantassa sāvakassa ovādakassa guṇaṃ pakāsayato aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapentassa katāvino sātaccakiccayuttassa vacanaṃ sutvāti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap535:6"]]},{"para":3431,"vripara":"73","refs":["tha-ap535:8"],"words":["haṃsasamabhāgo","haṃsadundubhinissano"],"lines":["<b>Haṃsasamabhāgo</b>ti haṃsasadisagāmi.","<b>Haṃsadundubhinissano</b>ti haṃsaravo dundubhibherisaddasadisavacano “etaṃ mahāmattaṃ passatha, bhikkhavo”ti āhāti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap535:8"],["tha-ap535:8"]]},{"para":3432,"vripara":"74","refs":["tha-ap535:9"],"words":["samuggatatanūruhaṃ","jīmūtavaṇṇaṃ","pīṇaṃsaṃ","pasannanayanānanaṃ"],"lines":["<b>Samuggatatanūruhan</b>ti suṭṭhu uggatalomaṃ uddhaggalomaṃ, udagyamanaṃ vā.","<b>Jīmūtavaṇṇan</b>ti muttaphalasamānavaṇṇaṃ sundarasarīrapabhanti attho.","<b>Pīṇaṃsan</b>ti paripuṇṇaṃ aṃsaṃ.","<b>Pasannanayanānanan</b>ti pasannaakkhipasannamukhanti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap535:9"],["tha-ap535:9"],["tha-ap535:9"],["tha-ap535:9"]]},{"para":3433,"vripara":"75","refs":["tha-ap535:10"],"words":["katāvino"],"lines":["<b>Katāvino</b>ti katādhikārassa etadagge ṭhitassa bhikkhuno ṭhānaṃ so eso muditāya pahaṭṭhacittatāya patthetīti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap535:10"]]},{"para":3434,"vripara":"81","refs":["tha-ap535:16"],"words":["sataso anusāsiyā","bārāṇasiyamāsanne","jāto keniyajātiyaṃ"],"lines":["<b>Sataso anusāsiyā</b>ti dhammena samena vacanena kāraṇavasena anusāsitvāti attho.","<b>Bārāṇasiyamāsanne</b>ti bārāṇasiyā samīpe pesakāragāme.","<b>Jāto keniyajātiyan</b>ti tantavāyajātiyā pesakārakule jātoti attho.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap535:16"],["tha-ap535:16"],["tha-ap535:16"],["tha-ap535:16"]]}]},"tika":null}
